PART 3 -- THE CONSEQUENCE: the line's domain stated with z*
====================================================================================================
  the mass-dependence of the residual (G070 V2's slope of log10(pred/obs) vs log10 M*):
    full sample : +0.159 per dex M*   (G070 V2 FAIL, |slope| > 0.10)
